OL,3,GNEWSAMan caught out by fake ketamine
OL,4,Adelivery jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed for his role in
OL,7,Fthe importation of up to #3.75m worth
OL,8,Fof ketamine.
OL,10,FJoel Freeman was arrested at a storage
OL,11,Funit in Wakefield on 11 August when he
OL,12,Fwas caught by police unpacking what he
OL,13,Fbelieved was a drugs delivery, Leeds
OL,14,FCrown Court heard.
OL,16,FHowever, the drugs had been intercepted
OL,17,Fby officers when they arrived at
OL,18,FBirmingham Airport from the Netherlands
OL,19,Ffive days previously, and were replaced
OL,20,Fwith a "dummy crate".
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
