OL,3,GNEWSAMan caught out by fake ketamine
OL,4,Adelivery jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FFreeman, 41, from Leeds, had initially
OL,7,Fdenied knowing the delivery contained
OL,8,Fdrugs before changing his plea. He was
OL,9,Fgiven a six-year sentence and could be
OL,10,Fforced to repay any ill-gotten gains.
